The review target `folder with spaces/sample.py` is a new, untracked file holding only the one-line `reciprocal` function. The same code also sits in the modified `sample.py` and in the untracked file `high`. No CLAUDE.md applies, so there are no convention findings. The main problem is that it returns 0 for an input of zero instead of raising an error. I found 5 issues.

